npc.name = Jack Hollow
dialogue.greeting = A fine day to have a head on your shoulders. I try not to take it for granted.
dialogue.profile = Let me see your profile.
dialogue.shelter_offer = What would help you settle here?
dialogue.shelter_body = A little shelter would suit these old bones. Leave room for my pumpkin and a few curious games.
dialogue.accept = I will build you a shelter.
dialogue.later = Perhaps later.
dialogue.accepted_body = Here is the plan. Come find me when my shelter is ready.
dialogue.shelter_done = Your shelter is ready.
dialogue.settled_body = A roof, a welcome, and no coffin lid. I could get used to this.
dialogue.gift = I brought you something.
dialogue.goodbye = Until next time.
dialogue.rescue_body = At last, fresh air! Jack Hollow, at your service. Invite me to your town and I shall bring a little autumn cheer.
dialogue.rescue_accept = You would be welcome at our Inn.
dialogue.gift.love = A delightful little treasure! You know the way to my hollow heart.
dialogue.gift.like = How thoughtful. This will brighten my evening.
dialogue.gift.neutral = Thank you. I will find a place for it.
dialogue.gift.dislike = An unusual choice. Perhaps something else next time.
dialogue.gift.love.birthday = For my birthday? You have made these old bones very happy.
dialogue.gift.like.birthday = A birthday treat! How kind of you.
dialogue.gift.neutral.birthday = Thank you for remembering my birthday.
dialogue.gift.dislike.birthday = You remembered my birthday. That is the part I shall treasure.

dialogue.reward.25 = A little sweetness for a kind friend. Enjoy these treats.
dialogue.reward.50 = A pumpkin of your very own. Wear it in good spirits.
dialogue.reward.75 = What a fine friend you have been. I saved my best treats for you.

head.name = Jack Hollow's Pumpkin
head.description = Bring this pumpkin back to Jack Hollow to finish your game. Pumpkins from cancelled games cannot be returned.
interaction.pickup = Press [{key}] to pick up Jack's pumpkin
dialogue.game_start = Let us play hide and seek.
dialogue.game_return = I found your pumpkin.
dialogue.game_cancel = Let us stop the current game.
game.unavailable = Speak to Jack Hollow in your town to play.
game.already_playing = My pumpkin is still waiting inside one of our buildings. Find it and bring it back to me.
game.busy = Someone else is looking for my pumpkin. We can play when their game is finished.
game.tomorrow = You have earned today's treats. Come back on the next game day.
game.cleanup_pending = Some old hiding places are still being cleared. Visit those buildings, then try again.
game.no_spot = I need a clear floor with a roof and room to reach it inside one of our nearby buildings.
game.started = My pumpkin is hiding inside one of our town buildings. Pick it up and bring it back for 3 Halloween candies and 5 gold. You can earn this reward once each game day.
game.not_found = Find my pumpkin and bring it back to me first.
game.return_inventory = Bring this game's pumpkin and make room in your inventory for 3 candies and 5 gold.
game.rewarded = Well found! Here are your 3 Halloween candies and 5 gold. Come back tomorrow for another game.
game.not_playing = There is no game to stop right now.
game.cancelled = The game has ended. We can play again when you are ready. Any old pumpkin is no longer valid.
game.someone_else = This pumpkin belongs to another player's game.
game.found = You found Jack's pumpkin! Bring it back to him for your reward.
game.full = Make room in your inventory, then pick up the pumpkin.
game.expired = This pumpkin belonged to a game that has already ended.
